# Build outputs of the design-canvas tooling, not sources:
#   *.html          — the seeded editor payload (~2 MB) written by seed-canvas.mjs
#   _measure.html   — the harness measure.mjs writes to render every artboard
# The .dc.html artboards, canvas.json, current-icon.png and README.md are the source.
*.html
!*.dc.html
